        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[We are excited to announce that the new JaKtA website is now live!]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>We are excited to announce that the new JaKtA website is now live!</p>
<p>Built with <a href="https://docusaurus.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Docusaurus</a>, our new site offers a sleek and modern design, improved navigation, and a wealth of resources for the JaKtA community.</p>
<p>Explore our documentation, join the <a href="https://github.com/orgs/jakta-bdi/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">community discussions</a>, and stay updated with the latest news and updates. We hope you enjoy the new experience and find it helpful in your journey with JaKtA.</p>
<p>Check it out now and let us know what you think!</p>]]></content>
